@startuml
title KodaMate - Sequence mise a jour des parametres

actor Utilisateur
participant "App MAUI\n(SettingsPage)" as App
participant "Distributeur API\nFastAPI" as API
database "Supabase\nPostgreSQL" as DB

Utilisateur -> App: Modifier nom/langue/caractere/etat
App -> App: Validation formulaire
App -> API: PUT /api/settings\n{champs modifies}
API -> DB: update table setting
DB --> API: ligne mise a jour
API --> App: 200 OK
App -> API: GET /api/settings
API --> App: etat final
App --> Utilisateur: Confirmation + UI synchronisee
@enduml

